  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Workflow-focused workspace",
    "overview": "Code Mortis uses compact controls, clear review states, and a neutral sidebar with green accents that follows the workspace theme. White light-mode surfaces, restrained borders, and Inter Variable keep repository lists, review evidence, and settings readable.\n\nThis is a description of the implemented interface, not an approved creative metaphor or image-led brand direction. Mascot and distinctive branding work remain deferred. Light and dark appearance share the same structure. Until a manual choice is saved, appearance follows operating-system changes while the app is open; the header toggle saves a persistent light or dark choice.",
